  "note": "Sixth contract set on Robinhood Chain mainnet, live since 2026-10-07 09:11 UTC: the fifth set with its collateral lane rebuilt a second time, after the second rescore. The price guard, the stock router, the treasury adapter, the credit pool and the collateral vault are new; everything else carried over from rhc-mainnet-v5 at its addresses, under the 48-hour timelock that administers every contract, with the one-hour timelock at contracts.escrowPauser keeping the escrow's brake. A draw judges the guard's pending reading whatever its age once it was taken in an earlier block; the timelock's guardian can remove a keeper at once; and a write-off slashes stakers only for the part of the loss the seized collateral leaves uncovered. verifiedOnChain is what the live check (checks/rhc-mainnet-v6.md) read back at the block it names: nothing mismatched, and one item owed, the buyback's price ceiling, whose restatement waits out the governance delay.",
